'''RED BUSTERS''' (レッドバスターズ reddo basutāzu) is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in Battle Cats. This event contains [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-red]] Uber Rare Cats from other events. This event was added on January 15th, 2015 in [[The Battle Cats]].

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 70%
}}

